  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Preventing maternal deaths and unwanted pregnancies in Eastern and Southern Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Preventing maternal deaths and unwanted pregnancies in Eastern and Southern Africa is a component of Preventing Maternal Deaths in Eastern and Southern Africa programme (PreMDESA) reported by FCDO with a funding type of 109 - Multilateral organisation and a budget of &#xa3;12,790,572. This project benefits Africa, regional. It works in the following sector(s): Reproductive health care, Family planning, STD control including HIV/AIDS, Population policy and administrative management.</narrative>
  </description>
